Sound effects

Versions 1.0.1 and earlier contain sound effects sourced from ICBM-Classic; those sounds are not
covered by this project's licence and remain subject to their applicable original licensing terms.
Beginning with version 1.0.2, sound effects are covered by this project's CC BY-NC 4.0 licence.

